WEBVTT

00:08:29.839 --> 00:08:31.073
on these deep dives.

00:08:31.097 --> 00:08:33.504
I can talk about it all day --
just ask my wife --

00:08:33.528 --> 00:08:36.207
but I want to move on
to something much more interesting.

00:08:36.231 --> 00:08:37.997
I'm going to take you on a deep dive,

00:08:38.021 --> 00:08:39.832
and show you what it's like to do one.

00:08:39.856 --> 00:08:41.007
We start up on the boat,

00:08:41.031 --> 00:08:43.136
For all this high-tech,
expensive equipment,

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.369
this is still the best way
to get in the water,

00:08:45.393 --> 00:08:47.132
just flop over the side of the boat.

00:08:47.156 --> 00:08:49.383
Now, as I showed you
in the earlier diagram,

00:08:49.407 --> 00:08:52.772
these reefs that we dive on
start out near the surface

00:08:52.796 --> 00:08:55.444
and they go almost vertically,
completely straight down.

00:08:55.468 --> 00:08:58.349
So we drop in the water
and go over the edge of this cliff,

00:08:58.373 --> 00:09:00.587
and then we start dropping,
dropping, dropping.